AstroHybrid kyty-hybrid patch series
------------------------------------
https://github.com/imnotsharingmyname/pcportastrobot, folder Source/kyty-hybrid: 36 patches on KytyPS5 (the
kyty_gpu bridge in src/hybrid/, tools/hybrid/, the ASTROHYBRID_* switches, pad relay, frame pacing and the
performance options named ASTROHYBRID_OPT_*). The series is a derivative of the GPL-2.0 KytyPS5 and is used under
GPL-2.0. It is applied here as 36 commits directly on the upstream tag, with the author recorded in each commit.
Running Kyty's renderer inside another process is that author's idea and work; the nativeps5 commits port the
bridge to arm64 macOS and extend its interface (src/hybrid/kytyGpuApi.h, ABI 1.6 and 1.7). Nothing else from
that repository (its launcher application, documents, release tooling), which carries no licence, is included.

